# terraform/ — Azure Infrastructure (Terraform)
#
# This directory will contain Terraform configuration files.
# Populated in Phase 3.
#
# Expected structure:
#   terraform/
#   ├── main.tf              — Core resource definitions (App Service, etc.)
#   ├── variables.tf         — Input variable declarations
#   ├── outputs.tf           — Output values (URLs, IDs)
#   └── providers.tf         — Azure provider configuration
#
# NEVER commit:
#   - terraform.tfvars       (contains secret variable values — in .gitignore)
#   - *.tfstate              (Terraform state — in .gitignore)
#   - .terraform/            (local provider cache — in .gitignore)
